    "title": "Prison for drug deal death of 24-year-old Kansas woman - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago JOHNSON COUNTY —A Kansas man who admitted his role in a drug overdose death is going to prison. On August 21, Jude Christina Dunn Gyllenbord sentenced 22-year-old Ahmad Mohammed Karraz to 144 months for the drug distribution death of 24-year-old Kylie Liston, according to the Johnson County District Attorney's office. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
